          "en": "I went to school every day."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "Rafi",
          "bn": "তোমার ছোট বোন কি তোমার সাথে যেত?",
          "tr": "tomar chhoto bon ki tomar shathe jeto?",
          "en": "Did your little sister go with you?"
        },
